  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> denote a curve <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> which is in the first quadrant and let the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> lie on it. Let the tangent to <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> at a point <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> intersect the y-axis at <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math> If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></msub></math> has length <math><mn>1</mn></math> for each point <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> on <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then which of the following is options is/are correct?"
  },
  "options": [
